---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHead from "../components/PageHead.astro";
import StitchedBand from "../components/StitchedBand.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — Ulu Lāhui Foundation" description="How Ulu Lāhui Foundation handles information on this site.">
  <PageHead
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy policy"
    lede="Short, plain, and honest about a site this simple."
  />
  <div class="section container-narrow" style="padding-top:8px;">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This site is served statically. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics scripts, and carries no
        third-party trackers. When you email us, the address you write from and the content of your
        message stay within our team.
      </p>
      <h2>Google Fonts</h2>
      <p>
        Fonts load from Google Fonts, which may log the standard web request information that any
        content delivery network logs. No font-related data is tied to you by us.
      </p>
      <h2>Newsletter and email lists</h2>
      <p>
        If you join the newsletter or write to us, we use your address only for the purpose you gave
        it: the newsletter, or the conversation you started. We do not sell or share mailing lists,
        and you can ask to be removed at any time.
      </p>
      <h2>Candid seal</h2>
      <p>
        The Candid seal on this site loads from Candid's widget service. Candid's use of that
        interaction is governed by their terms, linked from the seal.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If the site grows forms or payment processing, this policy grows with it, and the change is
        noted here rather than buried.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <StitchedBand leftHue="ulu-l" rightHue="kai" flip>
    <div class="qb q-kai-l" style="padding:30px 38px;">
      <p style="font-size:14px;">
        Questions about privacy: email us and we will answer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </StitchedBand>
</Base>